{
  "_comment": [
    "Workstream B oracle: engineering envelopes for PRINTED FDM parts, XY, dry, as-printed unless a key says otherwise.",
    "Deliberately wide: a value outside is not wrong, it is worth a look. Nothing from this file enters the data.",
    "Units: density kg/m3, tensileModulusXY GPa, tensileStrengthXY MPa (ultimate), elongationXY % (at break), hdt045 and hdt18 degC, tg and tm degC (DSC).",
    "hdt045 is as printed; hdt045Annealed is the upper limit after an annealing schedule (semicrystalline or crystallisable matrices).",
    "References (keys used in 'ref'): H = J.E. Mark (ed.), Physical Properties of Polymers Handbook, 2nd ed., Springer 2007; B = Brandrup, Immergut, Grulke, Polymer Handbook, 4th ed., Wiley 1999;",
    "C = CAMPUS / supplier resin families (moulded ISO 527/75 values, Covestro, BASF, DSM/Envalior, Celanese, Solvay, Victrex, SABIC, Arkema, Kuraray, Eastman);",
    "F = FDM filament data-sheet families (Bambu Lab, Polymaker, Prusament, BASF Forward AM Ultrafuse, 3DXTECH, eSUN, Spectrum, Stratasys FDM material data sheets);",
    "L = FDM literature: Ahn et al. Rapid Prototyping J 8 (2002) 248; Popescu et al. Polym Test 69 (2018) 157 (review of process-parameter effects); Dizon et al. Addit Manuf 20 (2018) 44; Brenken et al. Addit Manuf 21 (2018) 1 (fibre-filled FDM); Gent, Rubber Chem Technol 31 (1958) 896; Qi, Joyce, Boyce, Rubber Chem Technol 76 (2003) 419."
  ],
